                                    <h1>Complete Skincare Launch Package Cost &amp;mdash; India + GCC 2026 | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fef2f2;border-left:4px solid #ec4899;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#db2777;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD SKINCARE + BEAUTY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live skincare + beauty vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for skincare brands</a> with 4+ published D2C beauty brand case studies including <a href="/resources/Kama_Ayurveda_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Kama Ayurveda</a>, <a href="/resources/Plum_Beauty_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Plum Beauty</a>, <a href="/resources/Sugar_Cosmetics_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Sugar Cosmetics</a>, and <a href="/resources/WOW_Skin_Science_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">WOW Skin Science</a>. Plus <a href="/resources/How_Nykaa_Built_India_Largest_Beauty_Brand_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Nykaa growth story</a>, <a href="/resources/Ayurveda_Traditional_Wellness_D2C_India_Global_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Ayurveda D2C playbook</a>, seasonal <a href="/resources/Summer_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Summer</a> + <a href="/resources/Winter_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Winter Skincare</a> playbooks, and 11 GCC city-specific beauty pages (<a href="/services/gcc/dubai-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/riyadh-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Riyadh</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, Abu Dhabi, Dammam, Al Khobar, Kuwait City, Manama, Muscat, Ras al Khaimah). Every framework below is grounded in live category work.</div><p>Complete skincare launch package = brand + Shopify + photography + compliance + marketing + WhatsApp + subscription bundled. Bundled pricing 15-25% below piecemeal + faster launch (14-18 weeks vs 22-28 weeks piecemeal) + continuity through year 1. This piece breaks down what Rs 15L / Rs 40L / Rs 90L complete packages include.</p>
                                    <h2>Rs 15-25L complete launch package (Boutique)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Included:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Brand strategy + positioning + naming validation</li><li>Logo + visual identity + palette + typography</li><li>Packaging design (bottle + label + secondary box) &mdash; 3-6 SKU designs</li><li>Brand guidelines (20-30 page PDF)</li><li>Shopify Boutique build (Dawn / Impulse) + core apps</li><li>Skin quiz basic + subscription + WhatsApp integration</li><li>30-80 SKU photography (12-shot + video)</li><li>CDSCO cosmetic notification (up to 30 SKUs)</li><li>First 6 months marketing retainer (Rs 65K/mo Starter tier)</li><li>Ad spend management (spend separate Rs 40K-1L/mo)</li><li>Content library (20-30 pieces first 6 months)</li><li>Instagram + WhatsApp setup + first 6 months management</li></ul><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> 14-16 weeks brand + Shopify + launch + 6 months marketing. Total Rs 15-25L over 12 months.</p>
                                    <h2>Rs 40-60L complete launch package (Mid-market)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Included:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Full brand strategy + workshops + regional-heritage adaptation</li><li>Logo + full visual identity system + digital brand tokens</li><li>Packaging design 15-25 SKUs + inserts + care cards</li><li>Brand guidelines (30-45 page PDF)</li><li>Shopify Mid-market build (Impulse / Warehouse / custom) + full apps</li><li>Advanced skin quiz + routine builder + subscription + refill + WhatsApp Cloud API + multi-language</li><li>100-200 SKU photography + video + tutorial + before-after (compliance-safe)</li><li>CDSCO cosmetic notification (up to 100 SKUs) + BIS SPF + trademark</li><li>First 6 months marketing retainer (Rs 1.8L/mo Growth tier)</li><li>Ad spend management (spend separate Rs 1-4L/mo)</li><li>Content library (60-100 pieces first 6 months)</li><li>Instagram + Reels + YouTube + Pinterest + WhatsApp + email setup + management</li><li>Derm + creator partnership sourcing + management (4-8 creators / month)</li></ul><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> 16-18 weeks brand + Shopify + launch + 6 months marketing. Total Rs 40-60L over 12 months.</p>
                                    <h2>Rs 90L-1.5 Cr complete launch package (Full-range premium)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Included:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Enterprise brand strategy + heritage-storytelling + PR + Vogue-tier ambition</li><li>Full visual identity + regional-language adaptation + digital brand system</li><li>Packaging design 40-100 SKUs + inserts + care cards + gift-set packaging</li><li>Brand guidelines (45-70 page PDF) + team training</li><li>Shopify Plus + headless (if warranted) + advanced multi-region checkout</li><li>Full skin quiz + routine builder + advanced subscription + refill + WhatsApp Cloud API + Arabic + Hindi + multi-currency</li><li>300-500 SKU photography + video + tutorial + before-after + ad-creative + lifestyle + editorial + multiple skin tones</li><li>CDSCO + BIS + trademark + international registrations + halal + ESMA + SFDA</li><li>First 6 months marketing retainer (Rs 4.5L+/mo Enterprise tier)</li><li>Ad spend management (spend separate Rs 5-15L/mo)</li><li>Content library (150-250 pieces first 6 months)</li><li>Full-stack digital (Instagram + Reels + YouTube + Pinterest + Snapchat + WhatsApp + email + LinkedIn + PR + regional)</li><li>Derm + celebrity + micro-macro creator + luxury + PR + editorial (10-25 partnerships / month)</li></ul><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> 20-24 weeks brand + Shopify + launch + 6 months marketing. Total Rs 90L-1.5 Cr over 12 months.</p>
                                    <h2>Bundle vs piecemeal economics</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Bundle savings:</strong> 15-25% below piecemeal purchase. Rs 40L bundle = Rs 48-52L piecemeal equivalent.</p><p><strong>Timeline savings:</strong> 14-24 weeks bundle vs 22-28 weeks piecemeal. Single-agency continuity + no coordination overhead + no re-education cost.</p><p><strong>Attribution + coordination benefits:</strong> Shopify + marketing + content + creative + WhatsApp all in single-agency + single-source-of-truth reporting. Cross-team optimisation immediate vs cross-agency 4-6 week lag.</p><p><strong>Risk trade-off:</strong> Bundle single-point-of-failure. Mitigate with 6-month MSA + cancellation after month 3 + performance milestones + documented playbooks.</p>
                                    <h2>What is NOT included (pass-through)</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Ad spend (transparent pass-through, client pays platforms directly)</li><li>Inventory + manufacturing + raw materials</li><li>Shopify subscription fees + third-party app subscriptions</li><li>Third-party legal fees (trademark + registration + advisor)</li><li>Third-party creator fees + PR agency retainer (if not bundled)</li><li>Photography styling props + models + location fees (bundled at Mid-market + Enterprise)</li><li>Warehousing + shipping + fulfilment</li></ul><p>Transparent pass-through model. No hidden markups on ad spend or third-party services.</p>

