                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What does complete skincare launch package cover?</h3>
                                        <p>Brand + Shopify + photography + compliance + marketing + WhatsApp + subscription bundled. Rs 15-25L Boutique + Rs 40-60L Mid-market + Rs 90L-1.5 Cr Full-range premium. All includes 6 months post-launch marketing retainer.</p>
                                        <h3>What are savings from bundle vs piecemeal?</h3>
                                        <p>15-25% cost savings + 8-14 week timeline savings + single-source-of-truth attribution + immediate cross-team optimisation. Rs 40L bundle = Rs 48-52L piecemeal equivalent.</p>
                                        <h3>What is timeline for Rs 40L complete package?</h3>
                                        <p>16-18 weeks brand + Shopify + launch + then 6 months marketing execution. Total 12 months bundled with continuous team + attribution + optimisation.</p>
                                        <h3>What is NOT included in complete package?</h3>
                                        <p>Ad spend (transparent pass-through) + inventory + manufacturing + Shopify subscription fees + third-party app subscriptions + legal fees + third-party creator fees + warehousing + shipping. Transparent pass-through model. No hidden markups.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we go bundle or piecemeal?</h3>
                                        <p>Bundle for launch + first 12 months (attribution continuity + no coordination overhead + cost savings). Piecemeal for established Rs 5+ Cr / year brands with specialised needs. Bundle single-point-of-failure risk mitigated with 6-month MSA + cancellation after month 3.</p>
                                        <h3>What does Rs 15L Boutique package include?</h3>
                                        <p>Brand + logo + packaging (3-6 SKUs) + guidelines + Shopify Boutique build + skin quiz basic + subscription + WhatsApp + 30-80 SKU photography + CDSCO + 6 months Starter marketing + Instagram + WhatsApp management + 20-30 content pieces.</p>
                                        <h3>What does Rs 90L Full-range premium include?</h3>
                                        <p>Enterprise brand + heritage-storytelling + 40-100 SKU packaging + Shopify Plus + full skin quiz + Arabic + Hindi + multi-currency + 300-500 SKU photography + full compliance + Enterprise marketing + full-stack digital + derm + celebrity + creator + PR (10-25 partnerships/month) + 150-250 content pieces.</p>
                                        <h3>Can we phase the package over multiple months?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. Phased payment 30% signing + 20% at brand approval + 25% at Shopify launch + 25% at first-6-month milestone. Cash flow friendly + performance-tied. Standard on all Mid-market + Enterprise packages.</p>
